# imprecv vendoring notice

This directory vendors the core Typst source from imprecv 1.0.1 by Je Sian Keith Herman, licensed under Apache License 2.0. Upstream project: https://github.com/jskherman/imprecv. The build uses this local copy and does not import the package from the network.

The vendored `cv.typ` retains the style rules and heading/contact/work/education/project helpers. The unused endnote function was omitted because it adds generated text outside `data/cv.json` and is not part of this CV output. The CV template composes its own sections to put Education before Experience.
